# Scoped ignore for the documentation image build (build context = repo root).
# Keep .md sources, .vuepress/, backend/ and packages/branding/ (for schema:print
# + SpectaQL — the backend imports the branding package); drop
# the heavy build artifacts and installed deps so the context stays small.
**/node_modules
.git
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.nuxt
.vuepress/.cache
.vuepress/.temp
.vuepress/dist
.vuepress/public/api
cypress/videos
cypress/screenshots
cypress/reports
deployment/configurations
**/*.log
release
.env
**/.env
# Design/concept scratch (not in the site nav / SUMMARY.md, often WIP and not valid
# VuePress markdown). Keeps the local build in parity with CI, which only has
# committed files.
docu
